  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 54688064299008
    m_Localized: Eat my balls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2251481891880960
    m_Localized: You are more capable than you think, you just have to try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4342487563198464
    m_Localized: I remember when I could barely move anymore. My mother gave me a little bell to ring whenever I wanted something. All I had to do was ring it, and soon after, the door would open and there was my mother.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4342560908992512
    m_Localized: 'When I began to lose my sight. It was as if the walls were disappearing and I fantasized about being able to walk right through them. I also remember seeing flashes of a strange icon, something like this:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5787300321910784
    m_Localized: Entrance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5787394165268480
    m_Localized: Seems like the entrance of the house
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5787508111925248
    m_Localized: Bell Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5787621194555392
    m_Localized: A room with bells hanging on the walls and a big door without knob.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6148121342337024
    m_Localized: Four bells and a big door
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6148331808317440
    m_Localized: I found a strange room with four bells and a big door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
