  - m_Id: 6515358435729408
    m_Localized: Strange Icon Note
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6515644449513472
    m_Localized: I found a note about blindness and walk through walls. It has the same icon I saw at the dining room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6517163957772288
    m_Localized: Memo Secret Passage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6517753408479232
    m_Localized: 'In the secret passage I found a note saying: You are more capable than you think, you just have to try.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6518954992689152
    m_Localized: Bells Blueprint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6519211113668608
